          <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-500 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30">1</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Give Nigel a Call</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">Ring us on <a href="tel:0466140195" class="text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors">0466 140 195</a> or send a text. Tell us your vehicle make, model, and what glass you need replaced. It's that simple.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="reveal delay-200 text-center relative">
        <div class="relative mx-auto w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-400">
            <rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"/><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-500 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30">2</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Get a Free Quote</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">We'll confirm the details, check stock availability, and give you an upfront price — no hidden fees, no surprises. Best price guaranteed.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="reveal delay-300 text-center relative">
        <div class="relative mx-auto w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-400">
            <path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"/><path d="M15 18H9"/><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"/><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-500 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30">3</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">We Come to You</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">We arrive at your home, workplace, or wherever suits — fully equipped and ready to go. Most jobs done in under an hour. Back on the road, hassle-free.</p>
